    "notes": "<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>Diego Alvarez</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Occupation:</strong> UPP State Agent<br><strong>Age:</strong> 31<br><strong>Personality:</strong> Optimistic</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>ATTRIBUTES</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>STRENGTH:</strong> 3<br><strong>WITS:</strong> 5<br><strong>EMPATHY:</strong> 3<br><strong>AGILITY:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>HEALTH:</strong> 3</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>SKILLS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Close Combat:</strong> 2</li>\n<li><strong>Observation:</strong> 2</li>\n<li><strong>Survival:</strong> 1</li>\n<li><strong>Comtech:</strong> 4</li>\n<li><strong>Ranged Combat:</strong> 1</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>TALENTS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cunning</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Buddy:</strong> Liu<br><strong>Rival:</strong> Qiang</p>\n<p><strong>Signature Item:</strong> UPP Shoulder Patch</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>EQUIPMENT</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Custom Underwater Power Tool</strong> (DMG 2)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Backstory</strong></h3>\n<p>Born on an aquatic world plagued by scarcity and hardship, Diego Alvarez grew up in a community where survival was a daily struggle. Recognized for his aptitude in science, he earned a spot in a UPP state cooperative, specializing in underwater mining and serving as a company representative.</p>\n<p>Despite his corporate role, Diego is not the stereotypical company agent. His actions are guided by compassion and humanism rather than ambition or ruthlessness. His optimistic outlook and genuine desire to help others set him apart from his peers.</p>\n<p>Recently assigned to <strong>Matvey Station</strong> as part of an interplanetary exchange program, Diego enjoyed a carefree evening of drinking and card games with <strong>Dubov</strong> and <strong>Frenkel</strong>. Unfortunately, he overslept, missing the scheduled elevator departure to the surface. He awakens to find the station in lockdown and chaos unfolding around him.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "adhocitems": ""
  },
