          "comment": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Dive Suit Kit - for the foundry sheet automation, need to activate.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Each dive suit kit includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Air Supply</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Emergency kit: 15 minutes of air (1 Air).</li>\n<li>Standard kit: 6 hours of air (3 Air).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Water and Nutrient Paste</strong>: Sustains the diver during prolonged operations.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Energy Source</strong>: Powers essential equipment, including lamps, communicators, locators, and other small devices.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
